{
  "version": "map-order-analytics-nightly_refresh-v1",
  "unit": "nightly_refresh",
  "wave": 3,
  "rerun_posture": "required",
  "principal_map": {
    "public": "mart_readers"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Orchestration unit: sql/etl/12_sp_refresh_marts.sql (plpgsql, repo-only, hand-converted) becomes a Lakeflow Job (bundle target migration, schedule PAUSED) with SQL tasks in the legacy order 10 then 11, parameter run_date.",
    "The procedure body writes nothing: RAISE INFO logging and a DROP of mart.daily_revenue_stage, which is excluded by d-stage-exclusion and is not reproduced.",
    "Recon for this unit is a post-run read of the two marts the job rebuilt, pinned to the job's run_date; both objects are read-only here (the unit declares no write_targets; see order_analytics_analysis.md \u00a76 wave 3).",
    "customer_ltv has no run-date column, so it is read whole under the same max(loaded_at) < run_date precondition as mart_customer_ltv."
  ],
  "objects": [
    {
      "object": "migration_demo.mart.daily_revenue",
      "root_table": "mart.daily_revenue",
      "key": {
        "source": [
          "order_date",
          "region",
          "channel_group"
        ],
        "target": [
          "order_date",
          "region",
          "channel_group"
        ]
      },
      "scope_columns": [
        "order_date"
      ],
      "root_where": "order_date < DATE '${run_date}'",
      "target_where": "order_date < DATE '${run_date}'",
      "fields": [
        {
          "source": "order_date",
          "target": "order_date",
          "source_type": "DATE",
          "target_type": "DATE"
        },
        {
          "source": "region",
          "target": "region",
          "source_type": "CHAR(4)",
          "target_type": "STRING",
          "rules": [
            "rstrip_spaces"
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "channel_group",
          "target": "channel_group",
          "source_type": "VARCHAR(6)",
          "target_type": "STRING"
        },
        {
          "source": "order_count",
          "target": "order_count",
          "source_type": "BIGINT",
          "target_type": "BIGINT"
        },
        {
          "source": "gross_revenue",
          "target": "gross_revenue",
          "source_type": "NUMERIC(38,2)",
          "target_type": "DECIMAL(38,2)",
          "rules": [
            "decimal_round"
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "avg_order_value",
          "target": "avg_order_value",
          "source_type": "NUMERIC(38,4)",
          "target_type": "DECIMAL(38,4)",
          "rules": [
            "decimal_round"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "object": "migration_demo.mart.customer_ltv",
